@startuml C4_Plus1_CQRS_Sync
title Vista +1 (Sequência) - Replicação Assíncrona CQRS entre Instâncias Isoladas

actor "Cliente / Postman" as Client
participant "Instância 1 (:8091)\nRouteController" as Ctrl1
participant "CreateRouteUseCase\n(Command)" as Cmd1
database "BD Instância 1\n(airport_routes_8091)" as DB1
queue "RabbitMQ\naisafe.domain.exchange" as MQ
participant "Instância 2 (:8092)\nDomainEventConsumer" as Cons2
database "BD Instância 2\n(airport_routes_8092)" as DB2
participant "Instância 2 (:8092)\nRouteController (Query)" as Ctrl2

Client -> Ctrl1 : POST /api/routes (OPO -> LIS)
activate Ctrl1
Ctrl1 -> Cmd1 : execute(...)
activate Cmd1
Cmd1 -> DB1 : INSERT INTO routes & route_history (Write Model)
Cmd1 -> MQ : publish("route.created", RouteDomainEvent)
Cmd1 --> Ctrl1 : Route (ID=1)
deactivate Cmd1
Ctrl1 --> Client : 201 Created
deactivate Ctrl1

MQ -> Cons2 : Entrega mensagem na fila 'airport-routes.sync.8092'
activate Cons2
Cons2 -> Cons2 : Verifica idempotência (eventId != lastEventId)
Cons2 -> DB2 : UPSERT route_read_model (Read Model desnormalizado)
deactivate Cons2

Client -> Ctrl2 : GET /api/routes/1
activate Ctrl2
Ctrl2 -> DB2 : SELECT * FROM route_read_model WHERE id=1
DB2 --> Ctrl2 : RouteReadModel (com originName e destinationName)
Ctrl2 --> Client : 200 OK
deactivate Ctrl2

@enduml